  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For the past decade, Veranda&#x2019;s founders, Susan and Qamar Atallah, and their team have been implementing sustainability and agroecology projects across Palestine. For the past two years, they have continued their work towards achieving food sovereignty inGaza, despite their forced displacement. Susan and Qamar collaborate with a global consulting team of experts in environmental remediation, toxicology, sustainable design, ecosystem restoration, and epidemiology, while overseeing daily field operations incoordination with their team in Gaza, comprised of agricultural engineers, farmers, and skilled workers.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Veranda</narrative>
